WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:01.900
Tuna matufaha hapa

00:01.900 --> 00:03.433
pia tuna machungwa ninachotaka kujua

00:03.433 --> 00:06.733
ni uwiano,

00:07.100 --> 00:11.900
kuna uwiano gani kati ya matufaha na

00:11.900 --> 00:15.000
machungwa?

00:18.633 --> 00:21.566
kwa ufafanuzi zaidi

00:21.566 --> 00:24.033
uwiano unatupa uhusiano

00:24.033 --> 00:26.734
kati ya idadi ya vitu 2 tofauti.

00:27.234 --> 00:28.500
Kwa hiyo kuna njia mbalimbali ya

00:28.500 --> 00:29.800
tunazoweza kutumia kubainisha hili.

00:29.967 --> 00:32.200
Tunaweza tu kuhesabu idadi ya matufaha.

00:32.233 --> 00:34.200
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6.

00:34.566 --> 00:36.400
Tuna matufaha 6.

00:37.033 --> 00:39.033
Tunaweza kusema uwiano

00:39.033 --> 00:43.134
utakuwa ni 6 kwa ...

00:43.166 --> 00:44.733
Na je tuna machungwa mangapi?

00:44.766 --> 00:48.600
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9.

00:48.900 --> 00:50.733
Ni 6 kwa 9.

00:51.100 --> 00:55.266
Uwiano wa matufaha na machungwa ni 6 kwa 9.

00:55.792 --> 00:57.500
ungeweza pia kutumia njia tofauti.

00:57.500 --> 00:58.933
Ungeweza pia kuandika hivi

00:59.166 --> 01:00.966
6 kwa ...

01:00.966 --> 01:05.133
Bado ungeweza kusema uwiano ni 6 kwa 9.

01:05.766 --> 01:07.833
Lakini hatuwezi kuridhika na jibu hili

01:07.833 --> 01:09.934
kwa sababu njia nyingine ya kufanya maswali ya uwiano

01:10.100 --> 01:11.766
hususan tukiwa tunatafuta uwiano wa matufaha

01:11.766 --> 01:14.700
na machungwa, je tuna matufaha mangapi

01:14.700 --> 01:16.533
kwenye idadi fulani ya machungwa?

01:16.766 --> 01:18.100
Ukitumia njia hii, tunaweza

01:18.100 --> 01:20.566
kupunguza hizi namba,

01:20.566 --> 01:22.466
unawezakuwa umeshafahamu.

01:22.633 --> 01:26.600
Zote 6 na 9 zinagawanyika kwa 3.

01:26.967 --> 01:29.300
Kama ilivyo kwenye sehemu,

01:29.300 --> 01:31.267
tunaweza pia kufanya hivo kwenye uwiano.

01:31.433 --> 01:35.100
Kwa hiyo kama ukigawanya zote 6 na 9 kwa 3.

01:35.100 --> 01:37.001
6 gawanya kwa 3 ni 2.

01:37.500 --> 01:39.800
6 gawanya kwa 3 ni 2.

01:40.033 --> 01:42.733
Na 9 gawanya kwa 3 ni 3.

01:43.100 --> 01:44.833
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kusema

01:44.833 --> 01:48.000
uwainao wa matufaha na machungwa ni 2 kwa 3.

01:48.300 --> 01:50.034
Au tunaweza kuandika tu hivi

01:50.034 --> 01:54.266
2 kwa 3.

01:54.900 --> 01:56.134
2 kwa 3.

01:56.166 --> 01:57.233
Je imeleta maana?

01:57.233 --> 01:58.400
Angalia.

01:58.967 --> 02:00.733
Tumegawanya kila kundi kwa 3.

02:01.100 --> 02:02.301
Namna nyingine ya kufanya...

02:02.301 --> 02:06.400
Kama ukigawanya jumla yote katika makundi 3.

02:06.966 --> 02:09.866
Kwa hiyo kundi la 1

02:10.433 --> 02:13.066
kundi la 2

02:14.366 --> 02:16.266
na kundi la 3.

02:16.900 --> 02:19.233
Tunaona kila kundi,

02:19.233 --> 02:22.367
kwa kila matufaha 2,

02:22.367 --> 02:23.734
tuna machungwa 3.

02:23.900 --> 02:26.066
Kwa kila matufaha 2 tuna machungwa 3.

02:26.233 --> 02:29.267
Kwa kila matufaha 2 tuna machungwa 3.

02:29.700 --> 02:32.300
Kwa mara nyingine, uwiano wa matufaha na machungwa.

02:32.300 --> 02:35.000
Kwa kila matufaha 2 tuna machungwa 3.

02:35.366 --> 02:36.767
Tungeweza pia kutumia

02:36.767 --> 02:38.000
njia nyingine.

02:38.167 --> 02:40.667
Tungeweza pia kutafuta

02:41.366 --> 02:44.066
Tungeweza pia kutafuta

02:45.700 --> 02:48.266
uwiano wa machungwa na matufaha?

02:48.700 --> 02:52.200
Machungwa na matufaha.

02:52.566 --> 02:54.233
Na hapa tungebadilisha tu

02:54.233 --> 02:55.266
namba.

02:55.833 --> 03:00.466
Uwiano wa machungwa na matufaha.

03:00.633 --> 03:03.433
Zingatia, hapa tumesema matufaha na machungwa,

03:03.433 --> 03:07.167
ambao ni 6 kwa 9 au 2 kwa 3 kama tukirahisisha.

03:07.167 --> 03:08.633
Sasa tunaweza kusema uwiano

03:08.633 --> 03:11.000
wa machugwa na matufaha, tumezibadilisha hizi 2.

03:11.100 --> 03:12.600
Tunabadilisha na namba pia.

03:13.033 --> 03:15.400
Hapa tuna machungwa 9 kwa kila matufaha 6.

03:15.633 --> 03:21.200
Tunngeweza kusema uwiano utakuwa ni 9 kwa 6.

03:22.033 --> 03:23.734
uwiano ni 9 kwa 6.

03:24.033 --> 03:26.500
Au kama tukitaka kuzirahisisha, kwa kila machungwa 3...

03:26.500 --> 03:28.466
tutaigawanya kwa 3.

03:28.500 --> 03:30.766
Kwa hiyo kwa kila machungwa 3 tutakuwa na

03:30.766 --> 03:33.600
matufaha 2.

03:34.100 --> 03:36.466
Tutakuwa na matufaha 2.

03:36.500 --> 03:38.233
Zingatia, kama tulivyofanya awali

03:38.233 --> 03:41.300
lakini tulipotafuta uwiano wa matufaha na machungwa

03:41.300 --> 03:42.666
ulikuwa 6 kwa 9.

03:42.700 --> 03:44.734
matufaha 6 kwa kila machungwa 9.

03:44.833 --> 03:47.033
Na sasa kama ni machungwa kwa matufaha tunasema

03:47.033 --> 03:48.466
ni 9 kwa 6.

03:48.568 --> 03:50.600
machungwa 9 kwa kila matufaha 6.

03:50.700 --> 03:53.766
Au tunaweza kusema kwa kila machungwa 3 tuna

03:53.766 --> 03:56.533
matufaha 2.
